## Design patterns

none — one adapter per port, no repeated skeleton yet.

## Impact on approved use cases

| Approved case | Change | Why | Satisfied by |
|---|---|---|---|
| UC-003-place-order | appends `OrderChanged` to the outbox with the order's version | the projection is fed by events only — `@.claude/rules/search.md` § Boundary | this change, through UC-003's impact row |

## Implementation order

1. The dependency of § 9
2. `SearchIndexDefinition`, `SearchIndexBootstrap` in the search package — once per project
3. `orders-v1.json`, `OrderSearchDocument`, `OrderSearchIndex`
4. `OrderSearchAdapter` — after `SearchOrdersPort` exists
5. Properties in `application.yml`
6. Tests — `40-tests.md`: the alias exists at startup, a word finds the order, a tombstoned order is never returned, the cursor reads the next page
